# Backend Testing Rules

## Test Structure
- Use Vitest for all tests
- Test files: `src/tests/{ClassName}.spec.ts`
- Reset DI container in `beforeEach`
- Mock external services, not internal domain logic

## Coverage
- Domain logic: 80%+ coverage
- API resolvers/handlers: integration tests required
- Datasource layer: use test database (not mocks)
